    "summary": "Five studios behind Stake.com's exclusive games have spun off as new B2B iGaming provider Juice, opening a catalogue of more than 100 titles to operators worldwide. Juice comprises Twist Gaming, Knucklehead Syndicate, Monstrums, Massive Studios and The Originals, with the full portfolio delivered through a single remote game server integration. Twist Gaming and Massive Studios previously developed Stake.com titles including Drac's Stacks and Bank Basher; The Originals is dedicated to house games; and Monstrums focuses on emerging verticals including mystery box titles. To date the studios' games have generated more than USD 12bn in turnover. Roobet is the first operator to gain access.",
