    "meta": "Yogonet | 8 Sep 2026",
    "summary": "Win Systems has agreed to sell its Gaming Division, including the Gold Club electronic roulette business, to US-based gaming content and technology provider Primero Games. The division has an installed base of more than 3,000 gaming positions across Mexico, Peru, Colombia, Puerto Rico and Panama, plus customers in other markets. Win Systems said the deal brings together 'WSG's established international presence, product portfolio, manufacturing capabilities and customer relationships with Primero's game content, technology and development resources'. Primero's portfolio spans game content, online gaming solutions, redemption kiosks and an omnichannel platform, mostly US-focused, and the division will keep supporting existing customers.",
